{"4705620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WHERE the F$CK is my BITCOIN ⁉️", "steam_appid": 4705620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗑️ Welcome to the Dump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lost your Bitcoin. It's in here somewhere. So is a lot of other people's garbage. Start digging, start selling, and don't stop until the dump is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705620/extras/274af0d8d7f651afdd62aaefa67e6435.poster.avif?t=1781374426\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705620/extras/274af0d8d7f651afdd62aaefa67e6435.webm?t=1781374426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705620/extras/274af0d8d7f651afdd62aaefa67e6435.mp4?t=1781374426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHERE the F$CK is my BITCOIN ⁉️ is a co-op incremental sim about turning a mountain of garbage into a money machine. Dig piles by hand, sort treasure from trash, sell everything that isn't nailed down — then dump the cash straight back into faster gear and dirtier dumps. Play solo and zone out, or squad up with friends and turn the dump into a circus. One more pile. One more upgrade. One more run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, sort, sell, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pile is either worthless junk or the find that fixes your whole life. Usually junk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster hands, bigger bags, more stamina. Turn one sad guy with a trash bag into a junk-hauling machine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new dumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each landfill is dirtier, deeper, and richer than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring friends. Split the loot, or &quot;accidentally&quot; grab the shiny thing first. Friendship not guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About that Bitcoin…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's still out there. Probably. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗑️ Welcome to the Dump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lost your Bitcoin. It's in here somewhere. So is a lot of other people's garbage. Start digging, start selling, and don't stop until the dump is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705620/extras/274af0d8d7f651afdd62aaefa67e6435.poster.avif?t=1781374426\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705620/extras/274af0d8d7f651afdd62aaefa67e6435.webm?t=1781374426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705620/extras/274af0d8d7f651afdd62aaefa67e6435.mp4?t=1781374426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHERE the F$CK is my BITCOIN ⁉️ is a co-op incremental sim about turning a mountain of garbage into a money machine. Dig piles by hand, sort treasure from trash, sell everything that isn't nailed down — then dump the cash straight back into faster gear and dirtier dumps. Play solo and zone out, or squad up with friends and turn the dump into a circus. One more pile. One more upgrade. One more run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, sort, sell, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pile is either worthless junk or the find that fixes your whole life. Usually junk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster hands, bigger bags, more stamina. Turn one sad guy with a trash bag into a junk-hauling machine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new dumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each landfill is dirtier, deeper, and richer than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring friends. Split the loot, or &quot;accidentally&quot; grab the shiny thing first. Friendship not guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About that Bitcoin…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's still out there. Probably. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A co-op incremental dump-digging sim. Tear through endless trash, cash in your junk, upgrade your gear, and hunt for the Bitcoin you threw away. Dig with friends, get rich, get distracted, repeat.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Vietnamese, Greek, Danish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Romanian, Thai, Turkish, Hungarian, Ukrainian, Finnish, Czech, Swedish, Japanese, Indonesian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705620/6df37df224253fca108357127041572b7408576a/header.jpg?t=1781374426", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705620/6d1db729fa76f664eeac74ba5869df17dfeb198d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781374426", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705620/6d1db729fa76f664eeac74ba5869df17dfeb198d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t